    {
      "type": "model",
      "message": {
        "role": "assistant",
        "content": "I have the full problem. Let me solve it.\n\n**Problem:** A box has 5 balls labeled 1–5. Draw 3 times with replacement. Let $X$ = number of balls that are drawn at least once. Find $E(X)$.\n\n**Solution:** For each ball $i$, let $X_i = 1$ if ball $i$ is drawn at least once, else 0. Then $X = \\sum_{i=1}^5 X_i$.\n\n$P(X_i = 0) = \\left(\\frac{4}{5}\\right)^3 = \\frac{64}{125}$, so $P(X_i=1) = 1 - \\frac{64}{125} = \\frac{61}{125}$.\n\n$E(X_i) = \\frac{61}{125}$, so $E(X) = 5 \\cdot \\frac{61}{125} = \\frac{305}{125} = \\frac{61}{25} = 2.44$.",
        "tool_calls": [
          {
            "id": "call_f509120a2c834c1faa0f6c46",
            "index": 0,
            "type": "function",
            "function": {
              "name": "submit_solution",
              "arguments": "{\"region_id\": \"region_art_0014_01\", \"final_answer\": \"$E(X)=\\\\dfrac{61}{25}=2.44$\", \"reasoning\": \"题目：箱中有5个球，标号1~5，有放回地取三次，X表示至少被取出一次的球的个数，求E(X)。\\n\\n用指示变量法。对第 i 个球（i=1,…,5）定义\\nX_i = 1（该球三次中至少出现一次），否则 X_i = 0。\\n则 X = X_1 + X_2 + X_3 + X_4 + X_5。\\n\\n单次取到第 i 个球的概率为 1/5，取不到的概率为 4/5。三次都取不到第 i 个球的概率为\\nP(X_i = 0) = (4/5)^3 = 64/125，\\n故 P(X_i = 1) = 1 − 64/125 = 61/125。\\n\\n于是 E(X_i) = 61/125。由期望的线性性：\\nE(X) = Σ E(X_i) = 5 × 61/125 = 305/125 = 61/25 = 2.44。\\n\\n（也可用分布法验证：三次取出的不同球数 k 只能为1、2、3，P(X=1)=5/125，P(X=2)=60/125，P(X=3)=60/125，E(X)=(1×5+2×60+3×60)/125=305/125=61/25。）\"}"
